1226814  Push "Unleash the howl of your ancestors, dealing 240% of your Strength or 335% of your Instinct, whichever is higher, as Ice damage and stunning the target for 2 turns. Applies 3 Frostbite. This attack cannot be avoided."
1227034  Push "Unleash the howl of your ancestors, dealing 210% of your Strength or 295% of your Instinct, whichever is higher, as Ice damage and stunning the target for 2 turns. Applies 2 Frostbite. This attack cannot be avoided."
1227254  Push "Unleash the howl of your ancestors, dealing 180% of your Strength or 250% of your Instinct, whichever is higher, as Ice damage and stunning the target for 2 turns. This attack cannot be avoided."
1227453  Push 3
