1240176  Push "Consumes up to 3 Scent of Blood from your target, healing an additional 10% for each."
1240266  Push 2
1240274  InitObject
1240275  SetMember
1240276  Push "_root"
1240286  GetVariable
1240287  Push "__v14Desc"
1240301  GetMember
1240302  Push "809"
1240310  Push "r"
1240316  Push "Transform into an undead beast, increasing your Strength and Instinct by 35% and regenerating 12% of your maximum Health each turn for 3 turns."
1240464  Push "Transform into an undead beast, increasing your Strength and Instinct by 25% and regenerating 8% of your maximum Health each turn for 3 turns."
1240611  Push 2
1240619  InitArray
1240620  Push "m"
1240626  Push "Each Scent of Blood you consume during this effect extends it by 1 turn, up to 2, and heals you for 5% of your maximum Health."
1240757  Push 2
1240765  InitObject
1240766  SetMember
1240767  Push "_root"
1240777  GetVariable
1240778  Push "__v14Desc"
1240792  GetMember
1240793  Push "827"
1240801  Push "r"
1240807  Push "Make a last stand, reducing damage taken by 70% and damage dealt by 20% for 1 turn. Consumes all Scent of Blood from the most marked enemy, reducing damage taken by an additional 5% for each, up to 85%."
1241014  Push "Make a last stand, reducing damage taken by 55% and damage dealt by 25% for 1 turn. Consumes all Scent of Blood from the most marked enemy, reducing damage taken by an additional 5% for each, up to 85%."
1241221  Push 2
1241229  InitArray
1241230  Push "m"
1241236  Push "Enemies that strike you receive 2 Frostbite, and Brittle enemies become Frozen Solid."
1241326  Push 2
1241334  InitObject
1241335  SetMember
1241336  Push "_root"
1241346  GetVariable
1241347  Push "__v14Desc"
1241361  GetMember
1241362  Push "828"
1241370  Push "r"
1241376  Push "Passively reduces damage taken from damage-over-time effects by 30% and restores 5 Focus at the start of each of your turns. Consuming Scent of Blood removes 1 damage-over-time effect from you."
1241574  Push "Passively reduces damage taken from damage-over-time effects by 20%. Consuming Scent of Blood removes 1 damage-over-time effect from you."
1241716  Push 2
1241724  InitArray
1241725  Push "m"
1241731  Push "Consuming 3 or more Scent in one action makes you immune to stuns for 1 turn."
1241813  Push 2
1241821  InitObject
1241822  SetMember
1241823  Push "_root"
1241833  GetVariable
1241834  Push "__v14Desc"
1241848  GetMember
1241849  Push "829"
1241857  Push "r"
1241863  Push "Passively shields you for 10% of your maximum Health for each Scent of Blood or Frostbite you consume, up to 40%, for 2 turns. Increases healing received by 15%."
1242029  Push "Passively shields you for 7% of your maximum Health for each Scent of Blood or Frostbite you consume, up to 35%, for 2 turns."
1242159  Push 2
1242167  InitArray
1242168  Push "m"
1242174  Push "Freezing an enemy solid grants a shield equal to 15% of your maximum Health."
1242255  Push 2
1242263  InitObject
1242264  SetMember
1242265  Push "_root"
1242275  GetVariable
1242276  Push "__v14Desc"
1242290  GetMember
1242291  Push "830"
1242299  Push "r"
1242305  Push "Once per combat, when you would die you survive with 25% of your maximum Health, gain a shield equal to 20% of your maximum Health and remove all harmful effects."
1242472  Push 1
1242480  InitArray
1242481  Push "m"
1242487  Push "The enemy that struck the blow receives 3 Scent of Blood and 3 Frostbite."
