1266969  Push "Rake the enemy for 205% of your Strength. Also causes the target to bleed for damage equal to 45% of your Strength each turn for 3 turns, and grants you a 'Scent of Blood' on it, or two if it was already bleeding."
1267187  Push "Rake the enemy for 175% of your Strength. Also causes the target to bleed for damage equal to 35% of your Strength each turn for 3 turns, and grants you a 'Scent of Blood' on it, or two if it was already bleeding."
1267405  Push "Rake the enemy for 150% of your Strength. Also causes the target to bleed for damage equal to 30% of your Strength each turn for 3 turns, and grants you a 'Scent of Blood' on it."
1267588  Push 3
1267596  InitArray
1267597  Push "m"
1267603  Push "Against a Hunted target the wound will not close: the bleeding lasts 6 turns and cannot be dispelled."
1267709  Push 2
