1267749  Push "r"
1267755  Push "Awaken the instincts of an ally, increasing its Strength, Instinct and Speed by 25% for 3 turns."
1267856  Push "Awaken the instincts of an ally, increasing its Strength, Instinct and Speed by 18% for 3 turns."
1267957  Push 2
1267965  InitArray
1267966  Push "m"
1267972  Push "The rest of the pack hears it too: every other ally gains half of the bonus."
1268053  Push 2
1268061  InitObject
1268062  SetMember
1268063  Push "_root"
1268073  GetVariable
1268074  Push "__i1D"
1268084  GetMember
1268085  Push 626
1268093  Push "r"
1268099  Push "Unleash the howl of your ancestors, dealing 240% of your Strength as Ice damage. Scales with 336% of your Instinct instead, if that is higher. Also stuns the target for 2 turns and applies three 'Frostbite'. This attack cannot be avoided."
1268342  Push "Unleash the howl of your ancestors, dealing 210% of your Strength as Ice damage. Scales with 294% of your Instinct instead, if that is higher. Also stuns the target for 2 turns and applies two 'Frostbite'. This attack cannot be avoided."
1268583  Push "Unleash the howl of your ancestors, dealing 180% of your Strength as Ice damage. Scales with 252% of your Instinct instead, if that is higher. Also stuns the target for 2 turns. This attack cannot be avoided."
1268796  Push 3
1268804  InitArray
1268805  Push "m"
1268811  Push "If the target carried two or more Scents the howl keeps ringing: it loses 25 Focus at the start of each of its turns, and every other enemy takes one 'Frostbite' and loses 15 Focus."
1268997  Push 2
1269005  InitObject
1269006  SetMember
1269007  Push "_root"
1269017  GetVariable
1269018  Push "__i1D"
1269028  GetMember
1269029  Push 627
1269037  Push "r"
1269043  Push "Clamp down on the enemy with iron jaws for 220% of your Strength, destroying 20 Focus. If the target carries a 'Scent of Blood', consumes one to destroy 10 more Focus and prevent the use of any abilities that require Focus for 2 turns."
1269283  Push 1
1269291  InitArray
1269292  Push "m"
1269298  Push "Consuming the Scent also returns up to 25 Focus to you."
1269358  Push 2
1269366  InitObject
1269367  SetMember
1269368  Push "_root"
1269378  GetVariable
1269379  Push "__i1D"
1269389  GetMember
1269390  Push 628
1269398  Push "r"
1269404  Push "Tear at the enemy with frozen claws for 195% of your Strength as Ice damage. Scales with 273% of your Instinct instead, if that is higher. Also applies two 'Frostbite', or three against a bleeding target."
1269613  Push "Tear at the enemy with frozen claws for 170% of your Strength as Ice damage. Scales with 238% of your Instinct instead, if that is higher. Also applies two 'Frostbite', or three against a bleeding target."
1269822  Push "Tear at the enemy with frozen claws for 150% of your Strength as Ice damage. Scales with 210% of your Instinct instead, if that is higher. Also applies one 'Frostbite', or two against a bleeding target."
1270029  Push 3
1270037  InitArray
1270038  Push "m"
1270044  Push "Against a Brittle target you strike a second time for 60% damage and drive in one more 'Frostbite'."
1270148  Push 2
