1270179  GetMember
1270180  Push 808
1270188  Push "r"
1270194  Push "Share the primal breath of the pack for 3 turns. All allies regenerate 15 Focus each turn, gain 12% Speed and take 6% less damage."
1270329  Push "Share the primal breath of the pack for 3 turns. All allies regenerate 10 Focus each turn, gain 8% Speed and take 4% less damage."
1270463  Push 2
1270471  InitArray
1270472  Push "m"
1270478  Push "While the breath lasts, your allies cannot be slowed and cannot be frozen."
1270557  Push 2
1270565  InitObject
1270566  SetMember
