1270588  GetMember
1270589  Push 809
1270597  Push "r"
1270603  Push "Morph into an undead beast for 3 turns. Increases your Strength and Instinct by 35%, and regenerates 12% of your maximum Health each turn."
1270746  Push "Morph into an undead beast for 3 turns. Increases your Strength and Instinct by 25%, and regenerates 8% of your maximum Health each turn."
1270888  Push 2
1270896  InitArray
1270897  Push "m"
1270903  Push "Every 'Scent of Blood' you consume while transformed extends it by one turn, up to two, and heals you for 5% of your maximum Health."
1271040  Push 2
1271048  InitObject
1271049  SetMember
1271050  Push "_root"
