1271061  Push "__i1D"
1271071  GetMember
1271072  Push 810
1271080  Push "r"
1271086  Push "Pounce on the enemy for 150% of your Strength, dealing 30% additional damage for each 'Scent of Blood' on it. Also recovers 10 Focus per Scent and grants you 'Blood Rush', increasing your direct damage by 5% for 3 turns. Stacks up to 3 times."
1271333  Push "Pounce on the enemy for 130% of your Strength, dealing 30% additional damage for each 'Scent of Blood' on it. Also recovers 8 Focus per Scent and grants you 'Blood Rush', increasing your direct damage by 5% for 3 turns. Stacks up to 3 times."
1271579  Push 2
1271587  InitArray
1271588  Push "m"
1271594  Push "At three stacks of 'Blood Rush' the bite goes deep: the target bleeds for 30% of your Strength each turn and you gain another 'Scent of Blood'."
1271742  Push 2
