1271751  SetMember
1271752  Push "_root"
1271762  GetVariable
1271763  Push "__i1D"
1271773  GetMember
1271774  Push 811
1271782  Push "r"
1271788  Push "Passively allows you to track up to three 'Scent of Blood' on each enemy. Your bleeding effects on frostbitten targets grant you another Scent each turn. An enemy carrying three Scents becomes Hunted, receiving 15% additional damage from your team and unable to avoid your attacks."
1272074  Push "Passively allows you to track up to two 'Scent of Blood' on each enemy. Your bleeding effects on frostbitten targets grant you another Scent each turn."
1272230  Push 2
